sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Admin client
  participant API as Bevoac API
  participant MS as Microsoft Entra
  participant ARM as Azure Management
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Client->>API: POST /v1/onboarding/azure/start
  API->>DB: create session + state_hash + nonce_hash
  API-->>Client: authorizationUrl
  Client->>MS: admin consent
  MS->>API: GET /v1/onboarding/azure/callback?tenant&state
  API->>API: verify HMAC, expiry, anti-replay, api_key_id
  API->>ARM: discover subscriptions / verify RBAC
  API->>DB: upsert tenant_azure_integrations + tenant_azure_scopes
  API-->>Client: redirect success/action_required/error